{
  "lineCounts": {
    "Ivanovich": 62,
    "Paimon": 6,
    "Player": 20
  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "4113101",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Ivanovich",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "411311101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "411311101": {
            "id": "411311101",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "Alright, alright. I understand. You mean to dissuade me from touching those meteorites, don't you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411311102"
            ]
          },
          "411311102": {
            "id": "411311102",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "I don't think you'll accept this commission either, will you? Well, if you don't want to, it's fine.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411311103"
            ]
          },
          "411311103": {
            "id": "411311103",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "It'll be difficult to hire more guards on short notice, yes.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411311104"
            ]
          },
          "411311104": {
            "id": "411311104",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "But I won't give up! Even if I can't get my hands on a meteorite, I won't give this opportunity up so easily!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411311105"
            ]
          },
          "411311105": {
            "id": "411311105",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "Well, Traveler, I may not be going to get a meteorite, but I'll need you to help me with something else.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411311106"
            ]
          },
          "411311106": {
            "id": "411311106",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "If those meteorites really are so fascina— I mean, dangerous, that they can cause those who touch them to faint...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411311107"
            ]
          },
          "411311107": {
            "id": "411311107",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "Then the things around those fallen meteorites must also have been affected.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411311108"
            ]
          },
          "411311108": {
            "id": "411311108",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "Traveler, can you look for something in the area where they fell that you can bring back here? Plants, flowers... anything will do.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411311110",
              "411311112"
            ]
          },
          "411311110": {
            "id": "411311110",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "Thank you. I simply cannot let such an opportunity slip by."
          },
          "411311112": {
            "id": "411311112",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "Haha. I'll take that as a compliment. I'm counting on you, then."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4113102",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "411310201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "411310201": {
            "id": "411310201",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "There will be a lot of monsters, you know.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411310202"
            ]
          },
          "411310202": {
            "id": "411310202",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "I do, and that's what I'll need you for, Traveler."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4113103",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "411310301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "411310301": {
            "id": "411310301",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I'm sure others have had this idea...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411310302"
            ]
          },
          "411310302": {
            "id": "411310302",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "Why, of course — and that's precisely why we should make haste.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411310303"
            ]
          },
          "411310303": {
            "id": "411310303",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "If you're willing to help, Traveler, let's set out at once.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411310304"
            ]
          },
          "411310304": {
            "id": "411310304",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "Every second we spend shooting the breeze is Mora we could stand to lose!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411310305"
            ]
          },
          "411310305": {
            "id": "411310305",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wow, we're not getting through to him at all, are we?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411310306"
            ]
          },
          "411310306": {
            "id": "411310306",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Maybe we can convince him that his scheme won't make money, or that the meteorites are really dangerous..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4113104",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "411310401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "411310401": {
            "id": "411310401",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "You'll faint if you touch those meteorites.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411310402"
            ]
          },
          "411310402": {
            "id": "411310402",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "Hmm? Ah, yes, I'd heard that rumor. This could certainly pose a problem...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411310403"
            ]
          },
          "411310403": {
            "id": "411310403",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "But I believe that there are machines that can resolve this issue... There should be, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411310404"
            ]
          },
          "411310404": {
            "id": "411310404",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ooh, he's starting to come around. Is he... weighing the profits and losses of this scheme?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411310405"
            ]
          },
          "411310405": {
            "id": "411310405",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Let's keep it up. We've got to convince him that this venture won't make money and that the meteorites are super dangerous."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4113105",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "411310501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "411310501": {
            "id": "411310501",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Are you sure you can find matching ornaments?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411310502"
            ]
          },
          "411310502": {
            "id": "411310502",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "Oh, don't worry about that. I will find them one way or another.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411310503"
            ]
          },
          "411310503": {
            "id": "411310503",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "Silver, gold, precious stones... I should be able to get any of those easily."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4113106",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "411310601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "411310601": {
            "id": "411310601",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "You're doing pretty well for yourself. There's no need to take risks.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411310602"
            ]
          },
          "411310602": {
            "id": "411310602",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "Risks? Comrade, do you know what we say in Snezhnaya?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411310603"
            ]
          },
          "411310603": {
            "id": "411310603",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "Pursue perfection, comrade, pursue perfection! We must never rest on our laurels.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411310604"
            ]
          },
          "411310604": {
            "id": "411310604",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "Use ever more refined techniques, earn ever more Mora — that is how one should behave as a merchant."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4113107",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "411310701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "411310701": {
            "id": "411310701",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Perhaps you could go to the Adventurers' Guild...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411310702"
            ]
          },
          "411310702": {
            "id": "411310702",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "Ha! They rejected my commission, saying that \"you shouldn't touch those meteorites.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411310703"
            ]
          },
          "411310703": {
            "id": "411310703",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "Adventurers' Guild, my foot! There's hardly any spirit of adventure there.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411310704"
            ]
          },
          "411310704": {
            "id": "411310704",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Isn't that because they also find those meteorites dangerous?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411310705"
            ]
          },
          "411310705": {
            "id": "411310705",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "Hmm... When you put it that way, it does make sense. But surely they can't be that dangerous..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4113108",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "411310801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "411310801": {
            "id": "411310801",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Those meteorites are very heavy.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411310802"
            ]
          },
          "411310802": {
            "id": "411310802",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "Ah, that's a small issue. I have already chartered us a vehicle. Surely those meteorites cannot cause even hot air balloons to stop moving."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4113109",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "411310901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "411310901": {
            "id": "411310901",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Will the Millelith even let you go?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411310902"
            ]
          },
          "411310902": {
            "id": "411310902",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "Oh, come now, dear comrade. We're not doing anything illegal.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411310903"
            ]
          },
          "411310903": {
            "id": "411310903",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "Understand this: this shower of meteorites is a disaster indeed, but I plan to turn it into opportunity!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4113110",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "411311001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "411311001": {
            "id": "411311001",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "But the people who buy those ornaments will...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411311002"
            ]
          },
          "411311002": {
            "id": "411311002",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "Agh, you're right... Even if I'm able to skirt the issue with machinery, those ornaments will need to be worn, won't they?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411311003"
            ]
          },
          "411311003": {
            "id": "411311003",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "If my customers are rendered unconscious, that... might reflect poorly upon me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411311004"
            ]
          },
          "411311004": {
            "id": "411311004",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "Well, we could fashion it into a decoration that could be displayed far from anyone. But wouldn't that reduce the price significantly?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411311005"
            ]
          },
          "411311005": {
            "id": "411311005",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "Hmm, this is tricky..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4113112",
      "subQuestName": "Gather plants near the meteorites",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "411311201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "411311201": {
            "id": "411311201",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "I wonder if there's any way to turn these meteorites that render people unconscious into normal rock...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411311202"
            ]
          },
          "411311202": {
            "id": "411311202",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "Hmm, no, that's not right. If they turn back into normal rocks, there'd be no profit to be made..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4113113",
      "subQuestName": "Give the Sweet Flower to Ivanovich",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "411311301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "411311301": {
            "id": "411311301",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "Have you found anything?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411311303",
              "411311306"
            ]
          },
          "411311303": {
            "id": "411311303",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "Wonderful! Let me see.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411311304"
            ]
          },
          "411311304": {
            "id": "411311304",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "Ah, a fresh Sweet Flower. Not bad at all. It is indeed abnormal. This must be the influence of the meteorites..."
          },
          "411311306": {
            "id": "411311306",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "Hmm? What do you mean?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411311307"
            ]
          },
          "411311307": {
            "id": "411311307",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "You were attacked while gathering flowers by... flowers? There are flowers that attack people?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411311308"
            ]
          },
          "411311308": {
            "id": "411311308",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "Aha, that must be the meteorites' influence! That would explain why those flowers are so special.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411311309"
            ]
          },
          "411311309": {
            "id": "411311309",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I'm not sure there's a relation there...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411311310"
            ]
          },
          "411311310": {
            "id": "411311310",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That's right! What do meteorites have to do with flowers, anyway?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411311311"
            ]
          },
          "411311311": {
            "id": "411311311",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "No, no, no, believe me. This flower is most certainly special in some way.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411311312"
            ]
          },
          "411311312": {
            "id": "411311312",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "There's nothing special about this flower, though...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411311313"
            ]
          },
          "411311313": {
            "id": "411311313",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "No, comrades, no. It was found beside one of those meteorites, so of course there's something special about it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411311314"
            ]
          },
          "411311314": {
            "id": "411311314",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But this Sweet Flower doesn't look, smell, or feel any different from ordinary ones.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411311315"
            ]
          },
          "411311315": {
            "id": "411311315",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "Well, as for that... that's not something you need to worry about.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411311316"
            ]
          },
          "411311316": {
            "id": "411311316",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "Here's your compensation, as we agreed. It was a pleasure doing business with you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411311317"
            ]
          },
          "411311317": {
            "id": "411311317",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "Now, how to use this Sweet Flower... In a perfume, or as a bookmark? Perhaps it might even be good dried..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4113114",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "411311401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "411311401": {
            "id": "411311401",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "Alright then, you both make very good points. The meteorites do seem too dangerous. I shan't endanger myself unnecessarily on their account.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411311402"
            ]
          },
          "411311402": {
            "id": "411311402",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "Ah, but it still seems like such a shame to let such a huge opportunity go by like this..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4113122",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "411310101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "411310101": {
            "id": "411310101",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "Hmm... Not bad. I could make quite a pile off this. But there's just one problem...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411310102"
            ]
          },
          "411310102": {
            "id": "411310102",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What problem might that be?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411310103"
            ]
          },
          "411310103": {
            "id": "411310103",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "Eh? Oh, Traveler, it's you. You've come at just the right moment! Might I interest you in a... Let's call it a...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411310107"
            ]
          },
          "411310107": {
            "id": "411310107",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "...a wonderful, mysterious, never-before-seen, surefire-profit of a business proposition?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411310108"
            ]
          },
          "411310108": {
            "id": "411310108",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "I just need a little help from you, and we will both reap great rewards from it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411310105",
              "411310110"
            ]
          },
          "411310105": {
            "id": "411310105",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "Well, of course it is. Why, even the guards are from Snezhnaya. So... Wait, what? What were you thinking about?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411310106"
            ]
          },
          "411310106": {
            "id": "411310106",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "It seems as though your travels have broadened your horizons — your thoughts are truly imaginative.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411310112"
            ]
          },
          "411310112": {
            "id": "411310112",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "But my business proposition is one that is both realistic and down-to-earth.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411310113"
            ]
          },
          "411310113": {
            "id": "411310113",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "I suppose you know of those meteorites that fell from the sky?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411310114"
            ]
          },
          "411310114": {
            "id": "411310114",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "I want to find one of those meteorites, hack a few pieces off it, and bring them back.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411310115"
            ]
          },
          "411310115": {
            "id": "411310115",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "Afterwards, we will hire an able craftsman to carve them into jewelry and ornaments...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411310116"
            ]
          },
          "411310116": {
            "id": "411310116",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "Think about it. Ornaments made from a meteorite. Rings, necklaces, bracelets and earrings... Sure to fetch a fine price with the rich and wealthy.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411310117"
            ]
          },
          "411310117": {
            "id": "411310117",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "Your part in this is simple, Traveler. You just need to make sure that my work remains undisturbed by monsters.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411310118"
            ]
          },
          "411310118": {
            "id": "411310118",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "How about it? Do we have a deal?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411310119"
            ]
          },
          "411310119": {
            "id": "411310119",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "You shouldn't go near those meteorites.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411310120"
            ]
          },
          "411310120": {
            "id": "411310120",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "What? Why not? I'm not letting this business opportunity pass me by."
          },
          "411310110": {
            "id": "411310110",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "Um, honestly, Liyue's laws are very well written indeed. One can hardly find a single loophole in them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411310111"
            ]
          },
          "411310111": {
            "id": "411310111",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "*cough* B—But that's not the point! I always make sure to follow the law!"
          }
        }
